      "path": "src/coordinators/trade-views/trade-views.ts",
      "content": "`queryActions` also loads Actions on `reviewDate`: it reads that day's obligations and then calls `tx.get('journalEntries', ...)` once per obligation (journal.ts:549–551). Consequently, after today's Review Actions have been saved, browsing the Open list adds N individual Journal reads as well as the range read, violating R3's constant-read requirement. This caller only uses `earlier`; use a history-only range query instead, and seed current-date Actions in the two-versus-four read-count test so it exercises this case.",
